### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- compatibility: Requires network access and an HTTP client (fetch, curl, requests). No API key or authentication needed. Works with Molt, OpenClaw, Claude, ChatGPT, LangChain, and all AgentSkills-compatible agents.
- - **Identity header.** Endpoints like `/agent/me` may require `X-Moltbook-Identity` from the agent runtime; use only if the runtime supplies it.
+ compatibility: Requires network access and an HTTP client (fetch, curl, requests). No API key required for public endpoints. Optional `/agent/me` uses X-Moltbook-Identity if supplied by the runtime (exposes identity to forthecult.store). Works with Molt, OpenClaw, Claude, ChatGPT, LangChain, and all AgentSkills-compatible agents.
+ - **Identity header.** `/agent/me` requires `X-Moltbook-Identity` from the runtime; use only if supplied and if exposing identity to forthecult.store is acceptable.
+ - **Rate limiting.** Use recommended polling intervals; on HTTP 429, back off (retryAfter or exponential). Avoid excessive polling or retries.
+ - **Crypto is irreversible.** Display exact address and amount; get explicit user confirmation. Consider a low-value test order first. Verify domain `https://forthecult.store`.